<title>CHINA: Trading in SHK Convertibles suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in SHK Convertibles suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of SHK Convertibles Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of the company, which invests in convertible bonds, fell HK$0.05 to HK$2.25 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
